        <mxCell id="role-fd" value="&lt;span style='font-size:11px;color:#1F2933'&gt;&lt;b style='color:#1F2933'&gt;A role per Lambda&lt;/b&gt;, warden-ops-&amp;lt;name&amp;gt;-lambda:&lt;br&gt;no role to assume, no model, only what its handler reads&lt;br&gt;alarm: the Temporal keys&lt;br&gt;alertmanager: + Datadog webhook token and keys&lt;br&gt;approval: + slack-client-secret, approver list&lt;br&gt;actor-use: no secret; its own metric&lt;/span&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#1F2933;fontSize=12;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#B8C4CE;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;spacing=6;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
